    "title": "Color, fonts and background",
    "language": "html",
    "description": "Add the class site-header to the header and notice to the first paragraph. In <style>: body - font-family with sans-serif at the end, line-height without units, color in hex; h1 - font-size in rem; .site-header - linear-gradient and white text; .notice - a semi-transparent background. Do not use px units in this task.",
